Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mama, lots of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun, you're\Nso cool, no, ba-ba-ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or KissLet's goKill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or KissKill or Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just tell me one thing\Nyou have a first-class
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boating license why rich\Nmiddle-aged guys love?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a qualification collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm IT certified, a secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sommelier, a color designer, a\Ndrone operator, I'm a cosmetician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are the best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Kimmy's doing all right\Nfor now, but we still don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how to get the thing off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I need to break out\Nthe truth serum, I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make the Beastmasters tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lift out\Nhere, but this is where we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've fulfilled your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hitman hunter isn't\Na threat to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for me to face the head
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the family on my own\Nand figure out a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to convince him to grant me my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In short, I don't need\Nyou three any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama, I know you're\Ntrying to keep us out of danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to make me\Nspell it out for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question, this is 100 % a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Hikaru Gero from\Nthe Five Great Families!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out for You I can't\Ntake it it's not fair you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't have to risk your\Nlife for me I want to risk it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a voice inside telling me if I\Nwalk out on you now in your time of need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never make anyone happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as long as I get to clean\Nup the beast clan I'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the boat ride here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I need you to wait at the\Nharbor until I give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't in good conscience ask you\Nto come along to where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be prepping for our next matchmaking\Nstrategy, so you'd better come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that the Beast\NClan's using Arashiyama
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as bait to take out Pichi\Nand me at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Nbeen hunting them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what\NI did to piss them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's possible that they\Nthink of me as a business rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First a squid, now an eagle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama comes first!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H8B85F2&\pos(468,-6)}Toxin: Step Up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin! Step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultra-simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\fscx90\bord3\shad0\3c&H6E5241&\c&H3BCED7&\pos(187.71,57.29)\frz20.97}Ultra simple!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\bord2.5\shad2\fs30\c&H744F44&\3c&HF6E7E0&\4c&H442822&\pos(384,101)}Anyone can prep\Na squid like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\bord1.5\shad2\fs18\c&H694741&\3c&HE5D3CD&\4c&H442822&\pos(232,248)}Even a giant squid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How to chop up squid even\Nif you're out of your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real sorry, I'm gonna have to cook you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have guessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison masters can walk on water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step one.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.07,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs28\c&H455354&\pos(426.5,161)}Removing the entrails\Nfrom the body\Nof the squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove the entrails from\Nthe body of the squid.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.07,0:05:29.78,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\an8\fscx90\fs14\c&H455354&\3c&HE6ECEF&\pos(470,60)}Removing the entrails\Nfrom the body of the squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start by placing your\Nsquid on a cutting board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then remove the tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that those pesky\Nthings are out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right, take out the guts and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step two.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.17,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs28\c&H455354&\pos(418,129)}Removing\Nthe squid's ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Removing the squid's ink.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.17,0:05:45.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\an8\fscx90\fs14\c&H455354&\3c&HE6ECEF&\pos(480,58)}Removing\Nthe squid's ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slip the body open vertically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, after locating the ink\Nsack, grab it and pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lastly, cut that mollusk\Ninto bite-sized pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what Gero was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:06:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost scary how good\Nthis guy is with a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the café serves squid pasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm first up to bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No surprise seeing I'm\Nthe world's fastest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The living legend, Kota Hamishawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way this guy is a Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing he's a birdmaster\Nfrom a branch family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A subcontractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you lure us out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us dead for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell if I know. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he did, he wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking you down will make me so stinking\Nrich I'll be set for the rest of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm under a fancy-pants NDA,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but strictly between you and\Nme, I'll make tens of billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why involve her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was told if I nabbed the broad\Nfrom you first, the job would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:07:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not thrilled with kidnapping, but I\Ncan't go and let my feelings get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this, but deep down\NI've actually got a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only gone against my core\Nbeliefs one time in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a snowy night, which\Nwas unusual for March.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in the middle of\Npractice when the crane
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had formed a last-minute\Nbattery with said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's monologuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, this badass swooped\Nin and took their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I remove the Bondiconstrictor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd love to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trying to find\Nout is a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for birch ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdsball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His branch must be close\Nto the main family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:08:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a chicken or\Nyou're about to be kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can face him head to head on my\Nown terms, This game's in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making enemies with the poison gland\Nstupid, but the money's too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be from one of\Nthe five great families,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not like they're the top five
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,families when it comes\Nto a straight-up fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need is to hit this out of\Nthe park and my life turns around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I finish this job, I'm flying\Nstraight to America, home of baseball,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and breaking free of the rule books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till they get a load of Birdsball.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\fnImpact\blur0.3\bord6\shad0\fs100\pos(320,98)\c&H090097&\3c&H53FFFB&}Birdsball
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\fnImpact\blur0.3\bord2\shad0\fs100\pos(320,98)\c&H090097&\3c&H8ABCE6&}Birdsball
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.17,0:08:37.93,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\an8\fs60\b1\alpha&H50&\blur0.3\c&H0F377D&\pos(324,22.66)}Fish egg monitor
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.17,0:08:37.93,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\an8\fs60\b1\blur0.3\c&HBDE8FB&}Fish egg monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a poor matchup for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison master might\Nfall to the bird master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that birdbrain\Nwho's in over his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, my heart's racing in anticipation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason the\NPoison Clan has managed to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,survive this long is thanks\Nto traps and foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he has something planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His venomous fangs gnaw away at you, and\Nby the time you realize what's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so worked up, I can\Nbarely contain myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Poison Master Hikaru Gero,\Nlet's see those tricks of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Entertain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the winner,\Nso chicken for dinner!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Birdsball Modified Bloodline++
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdsball: Winning Shot!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.29,0:09:38.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\an8\alpha&H15&\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\bord3\shad0\fscx90\fs30\fsp3\c&H8B85F2&\4c&H817DBA&\pos(320,138)\3c&H190C69&}Increment
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.47,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an8\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&HF4E1FC&\3c&HF5E5F3&}Fowl Stadium Farewell
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Val Stadium farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place for you\Nto hide out in the open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, the scent tells me it's\None of his other tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to buy himself\Ntime to set up a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for him, we're on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seabreeze ought to clear this up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, just to be\Nabsolutely sure. Birdsball!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.21,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Birdsball: {\alpha&HFF&\t(1630,1631,\alpha&H15&)}Reverse Swing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avian Iron!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.12,0:10:10.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.4\shad1\fscx90\fs120\c&H8B85F2&\pos(290,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Avian {\alpha&HFF&\t(255,256,\alpha&H15&)}Iron
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sucked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if you are the\Nfastest guy around, Birdmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get very far against\Nguys who don't play fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole point of a trap\Nis to catch you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes them such\Nan effective technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing you his hand was the real trap.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\pos(215,220)\bord2.5\shad0\fs28\blur0.5\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H261C32&\3c&H261C32&}Puff\NPuff
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\pos(215,220)\bord0\shad0\fs28\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H9561B0&}Puff\NPuff
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord1.2\shad0\fs25\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\pos(343.33,208.67)}Extra
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord0\shad0\fs25\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&HD0C0C6&\pos(343.33,208.67)}Extra
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord1.2\shad0\fs20\blur2\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&HC9BCC0&\pos(366,207)\3c&HC9BCC0&}smoke!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord0\shad0\fs20\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H121010&\pos(366,207)}smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psyking him out with scented smoke\Nand straining his resources was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had to wait for the right opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With some help from Toxin's step-up,\NI launched myself and grounded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've still got questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know where the Beastmaster is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize you're not going to\Nmake it all the way to the top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many enemies are there another trick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nice try some things\Nare secret like how the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clan Mobilized all the\Nmajor and minor branches
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well in terms of threats though he can't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help himself It's like\Nhe wants to spill all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their secrets want to\Nget the Bonda constrictor
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off it's never Gonna happen but i did hear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rumor about this one time the beast clan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One two. Testing, testing.\NIs this thing on hello
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hikaru gato this is\Nbeast master toshiro dogo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the dogo animal kingdom\Ni am the king of this here rock
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're getting to know each\Nother how about clearing up these
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stories i Keep hearing about word\Nis the future head of the ghetto
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.66,0:11:56.54,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\fs9\blur0.3\c&HABAAAD&\frz4.615\pos(271,64.5)}Hikaru Gero
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family keeps taking jobs that don't\Npay Squats changing your line of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work huh you're a bodyguard i am a\Nbachelor i'm looking for a Partner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as for the jobs i'm helping\Npeople so i can meet women
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,used that girl as bait But i couldn't\Nfigure out why it worked i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the future heir of the poison clan\Nreeled in by Some useless chick
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mystery solved you're considering\Nmarrying her a word to the wise
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it. The Poison Clan has spent\Ncenturies refining their bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an SSR work of art. You'd\Nbe tanking the whole industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy like you with money\Nand power shouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurting to score chicks with\Ngood blood Lucky for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she doesn't have to\Nlisten to your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this one's smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of marriage, don't Bird and\NSpearmaster make the perfect duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, never forget that he who\Nholds the blood holds the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dawn of a new era, so I certainly\Nhope you're on the edge of your seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.05,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(316,262)}The Animal {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}Kingdom
