Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever he is, his blood jacks up\Nphysical and cognitive abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now they're all mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just from lopping off\Nsome branch families.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to put these to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Byakko, it's time to execute the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And reach our goal, crushing\Nthem once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:20:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My situation keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows when the Beastmaster will\Nchange his mind and dispose of Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still not fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we waste any more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a handbush!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and enjoy the warmth of\Nmy thigh pillows while you heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some master I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's ever hired me for a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.55,0:21:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole clan thinks I'm a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never once wanted or\Nbothered to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, all I can do is hide\Nand watch while others get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I had tried harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could things have turned out differently?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was more ambitious,\Nwe wouldn't even be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a master, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was so busy focused on helping you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never stopped to consider\Nwhat you were capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.37,0:22:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to start\Nover, Hamster Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, and kick the\NBeast Clan's ass together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, fake that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.47,0:23:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, fake that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watermaster, lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best fit for you. I love me!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.26,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}Good-for-Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.73,0:23:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, good for nothing.

